      "year": 1922
    }
  },
  "sources": [
    {
      "language": "es-ES",
      "url": "https://archive.org/details/obrasdestateresa07tere",
      "edition": "Obras de Sta. Teresa de Jesús, ed. P. Silverio de Santa Teresa, C.D., t. 7: Epistolario (I): cartas I–CLVII (Biblioteca Mística Carmelitana), Burgos: El Monte Carmelo, 1922. Wellesley College scan, the only OCR used.",
      "description": "Spanish critical text of the letters with Silverio's headings (addressee, place and date), summaries and notes kept as footnotes; his introduction, indexes and appendices are not included. Single-scan OCR cleaned by script, not proofread.",
      "tier": "A",
      "tierEvidence": "Teresa died in 1582; the volume was published in 1922 (public domain in the US) and P. Silverio died in 1954, so his notes are public domain under life+70 since 1 January 2025."
    },
